[b]Ultimate and skills[/b]
[list]
    [*]The ultimate Gigantism does not make the player smaller after a rush and the other skills are grayed out (car not activated during the duration of Gigantism);
    [*]The ultimate Storm pushes players a little more dynamically and goes faster and further;
    [*]The Shamanism skill at the right description;
[/list]​

[b]Consumables[/b]
[list]
    [*]The quantity of consumables is displayed on the player interface;
    [*]The keys are displayed below the consumables on the player's interface;
    [*]It is no longer possible to activate 2 consumables of the same type (care / mana);
[/list]​

[b]Gold and shop[/b]
[list]
    [*]​The gold does not rise every second that the Octryss is not disabled;
    [*]The gold can not go below 0;
    [*]It is possible to buy an implant directly by clicking on the icons;
[/list]​

[b]General[/b]
[list]
    [*]​The respawn time was increased when the team reached level 20;
    [*]Announcer do not appear in a loop
    [*]The avatar is no longer stuck after being stunned by the Leopard Jumping skill;
    [*]The attack range of the boss has been reviewed;
[/list]​

